id: food-materialization
name: Food Materialization
advancement: true
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Cooking
tpCost: 5
allowsTag: food
noHarderAt: cooking=4
source: Core Rule
text: >
  Food Materialization: Thanks to your skills in the kitchen, you are able to conjure food from thin air.
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in Cooking
  –TP Cost: 5 TP
  –Effect: You may create Basic Items with the [Food] tag through Magical Materialization. If you have 4+
  Skill Ranks in Cooking, you do not increase the Difficulty Category of a Basic Item with the [Food] tag
  that would be created through this effect.

---
